@title Final Fantasy Tactics Advance (USA)
@file Final Fantasy Tactics Advance (U) [!].gba
@game AFXE
@chip FLASH512
@frozen dingbat-bios,mgba,nba
@save skip: the first save is on the Ivalice world map after the snowball fight, the dream and the first clan battle; the battles cannot be frozen because the three emulators roll different random numbers from New Game on (unit stats, then turn order and AI moves), so the same inputs play a different battle on each

# Title > NEW GAME > A through the school scenes > name entry (START, then
# LEFT to Yes on "Confirm action. OK?", which defaults to No) > the
# snowball-fight tutorial > Ritz's first turn: Wait.
# Finding: at Ritz's first turn (ritz_menu, f11221+) dingbat-bios shows Ritz
# HP 19/19 while mgba and nba show 18/18. After Ritz waits, mgba stops on
# the "Ah, there's a trick to throwing a snowball, too." hint while
# dingbat-bios and nba run an AI turn, and by f11941 dingbat-bios and nba
# have moved different kids (after_ritz / diverged checkpoints, compare=none).
# The battle's random numbers depend on something besides the input timeline
# on every emulator, so no frozen route through it exists.

[new]
wait 600
wait 600
tap START times=4 every=60 hold=4
checkpoint title window=0
press A
# mash A until text Name timeout=6000 every=40  [taps dingbat-bios:82 mgba:82 nba:82]
tap A times=82 every=40 hold=4
# mash A until text Enter timeout=3000 every=40  [taps dingbat-bios:5 mgba:5 nba:5]
tap A times=5 every=40 hold=4
wait 30
checkpoint name_entry window=0
press START
# until text Confirm timeout=300 every=5  [reached dingbat-bios+5 mgba+5 nba+5]
wait 9
wait 30
press LEFT after=20
press A after=60
wait 60
tap A times=10 every=40 hold=6
press RIGHT after=20
wait 300
tap A times=10 every=40 hold=6
tap A times=15 every=40 hold=6
tap A times=15 every=40 hold=6
wait 60
press A after=50
press A after=50
tap A times=15 every=50 hold=6
wait 120
wait 200
tap A times=10 every=50 hold=6
tap A times=10 every=50 hold=6
tap A times=10 every=50 hold=6
tap A times=10 every=50 hold=6
tap A times=10 every=50 hold=6
wait 30
press B after=40
checkpoint ritz_menu window=0
press DOWN after=15
press DOWN after=15
press A after=30
press A after=60
wait 200
checkpoint after_ritz window=0 compare=none
wait 300
checkpoint diverged window=0 compare=none

